| --- |

| **OI-FAW-01 — In-application notification mechanism (Finance Approval Workflow Section 8) — RESOLVED**** RESOLVED by this specification. All five Finance Approval Workflow notification touchpoints defined in Functional Requirements: Finance Approval Workflow v1.2 Section 8 are fully implementable. The notification delivery mechanism, content, recipient resolution, and deep-link routing for all five FAW events (BUDGET_SUBMITTED, BUDGET_APPROVED, BUDGET_REJECTED, BUDGET_VERSION_APPROVED, BUDGET_VERSION_REJECTED) are specified in Sections 4 and 5 of this document.** |
| --- |

